hapter«first_verseªlast_verse¦verses’„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ[But ye, beloved, building up yourselves on your most holy faith, praying in the Holy Ghost,¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙekeep yourselves in the love of God, looking for the mercy of our Lord Jesus Christ unto eternal life.¦layout ªlast_verse…¤book@§chapter«first_verseªlast_verse¦verses’„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ1And of some have compassion, making a difference:¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙfand others save with fear, pulling them out of the fire; hating even the garment spotted by the flesh.¦layout ªlast_verse…¤book@§chapter«first_verseªlast_verse¦verses’„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ…Now unto him that is able to keep you from falling, and to present you faultless before the presence of his glory with exceeding joy,¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙdto the only wise God our Saviour, be glory and majesty, dominion and power, both now and ever. Amen.¦layout ªlast_verse